id: pm-vcs-15ab
title: "The packed-consumer acceptance test hardcodes the pinned SDK version, so every pm-cli dependency update fails CI"
description: "test/composition-consumer.test.ts asserted the installed @unbrained/pm-cli version and the consumer's reported sdk field against the literal 2026.10.10. Dependabot's pm toolchain update (pull request 107, 2026.10.10 to 2026.10.11) therefore failed test (22) and test (26) with actual 2026.10.11 versus expected 2026.10.10, and every later pm-cli bump would fail the same way, although nothing was wrong with the bump. The test's intent is that the consumer runs exactly the SDK this repository pins, so it now reads the exact devDependency pin from package.json, refuses a range, and asserts the installed SDK and the reported sdk against that pin."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: ci,dependencies,tests
