close_reason: "Fixed in test/composition-consumer.test.ts: the consumer now asserts the exact @unbrained/pm-cli devDependency pin read from package.json and refuses a range. Verified: the test passes at the 2026.10.10 pin, and passes again with the pin moved to 2026.10.14 and that release installed (reported sdk 2026.10.14), with no edit to the test."
